 Vlak 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Kunstpunt Groningen invites artists to propose a temporary\, si
 te-specific artwork for the Tschumi Pavilion on Hereplein\, Groningen\, vi
 ewable from outside\, that responds to current social and often polarised 
