 ments. No application fee.\nDuration: One year\, 1 September 2027 to 31 Au
 gust 2028\, renewable in some placements\n\nMore: https://www.aaas.org/pro
 grams/science-technology-policy-fellowships?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
