 ased funder\, worldwide reach. US 501(c)(3) nonprofits\, government agenci
 es\, schools and universities\, and international nonprofits and schools\;
  individuals\, collectives and radio clubs apply through a nonprofit fisca
 l sponsor.\nAward: No fixed range is stated on the apply page\, but ARDC's
  published 2026 grant portfolio shows awards from USD 1\,285 up to USD 258
 \,000 (for example GNU Radio 4 at USD 258\,000). No application fee.\nDura
 tion: Quarterly grant cycles (deadlines 15 January\, 1 April\, 1 July\, 1 
