 rand (European Commission / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States and countri
 es associated to Creative Europe. For organisations (legal entities) estab
 lished in an eligible country\; natural persons cannot apply.\nAward: Up t
 o EUR 500\,000 per project at a 70 percent funding rate\; total call budge
