SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Frankfurt Moves! Frankfurt LAB Residency Stipen
 d 2027
DESCRIPTION:Closes 07 Dec 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nFrankfurt Moves!\, an initi
 ative of KfW Stiftung run with the Frankfurt LAB (the production space sha
 red by Ensemble Modern\, Dresden Frankfurt Dance Company\, Hessische Theat
 erakademie\, HfMDK Frankfurt and Mousonturm)\, offers four two-step reside
 ncies for emerging performing artists\, solo or in teams of up to two.\n\n
 Organisation: Frankfurt LAB and KfW Stiftung\nLocation: Frankfurt am Main\
 , Germany (four weeks on site)\, then four weeks remote from the artist's 
 country of residence. For artists trained in Africa\, Asia\, Latin America
  or the WANA region.\nAward: EUR 2\,750 gross stipend per person (EUR 2\,0
 00 for the Frankfurt month\, EUR 750 for the remote month)\, plus four wee
 ks of accommodation\, round-trip travel to Frankfurt and up to EUR 800 for
  artistic work expenses per person or team. No application fee.\nDuration:
  26 July to 22 August 2027 in Frankfurt\, then 23 August to 19 September 2
 027 remote\n\nMore: https://frankfurt-lab.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Op
 en-Call_Frankfurt-Moves_EN_2027.pdf?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
 utm_medium=referral
URL:https://frankfurt-lab.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Open-Call_Frankfurt
 -Moves_EN_2027.pdf?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referr
 al
LOCATION:Frankfurt am Main\, Germany (four weeks on site)\, then four weeks
  remote from the artist's country of residence. For artists trained in Afr
 ica\, Asia\, Latin America or the WANA region.
END:VEVENT
